strates a quality in its VRM, performance and expandability that make it surpass its  sister Z390 APEX\n\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SPAIN</span> <span>01/31/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS XI GENE Media review Award of Excellent\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://newesc.com/review-asus-rog-maximus-xi-gene-z390/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1337/201911252353119720633.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Platinum\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Profesional Review\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Platinum</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Super cooling and brutal performance with overclocking\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SPAIN</span> <span>12/11/2018</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS XI GENE Media review Award of Platinum\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.profesionalreview.com/2018/12/11/asus-rog-maximus-xi-gene-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1333/15307.jpg\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Top Product\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      www.pcrevue.sk\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Top Product</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Common users are often mistaken about the fact that a smaller computer is weaker in performance or at least does not offer so many options. However, this myth is clearly refuted by Maximus XI Gene. In this small body, this is unrivaled even for computers where the highest available performance is required.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SLOVAKIA</span> <span>10/16/2019</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS XI GENE Media review Award of Top Product\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"www.pcrevue.sk/a/ASUS-Maximus-XI-Gene---Najnadupanejsia-doska-formatu-mATX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1333/15322.jpg\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Top Product\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      PC Revue\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Top Product</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Common users are often mistaken about the fact that a smaller computer is weaker in performance or at least does not offer so many options. However, this myth is clearly refuted by Maximus XI Gene. In this small body, this is unrivaled even for computers where the highest available performance is required.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SLOVAKIA</span> <span>10/14/2019</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS XI GENE Media review Award of Top Product\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2PiTypj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1339/15556.jpg\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"EXTREME AWARD\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Bit-Tech\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>EXTREME AWARD</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      “What it has delivered is exactly what many of us wanted - a flagship board that overclocks like a trooper and makes you go 'phwoar!', but Asus hasn't just included features for the sake of it - they're genuinely useful for both extreme overclockers and those looking to splash a couple of grand or more on a PC designed to turn heads. The ROG Strix Z390-I Gaming had hints of this, but the new Gene hits the nail on the head - so much so that we don't really care how much it is, we just want one, and that's exactly the feeling a true ROG board should inspire.”\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>UNITED KINGDOM</span> <span>02/14/2019</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS XI GENE Media review Award of EXTREME AWARD\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.bit-tech.net/reviews/tech/Motherboards/asus-rog-maximus-xi-gene-review/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-video\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Video_review\" class=\"ProductAwardVideo__productAwardPagePadding__Z+Cw7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__line__wNtmI\" style=\"display:none;\"></div> <!----> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-media\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Media_review\"><!----> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__rewardMoreButton__7-dJ4\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Media review\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"ht